    "BrochureContent": [
      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "\nSherry FitzGerald O'Donovan are delighted to bring this charming 2 bed semi detached home to the market offering an excellent oppertunity for first time buyer or investor alike.\n\nSituated on the outskirts of Castletownroche village and elevated over the Awbeg valley, the property offers potential with garden to the side and rear and off-street parking. It is convenient to all amenities including shops, pharmacy, schools, church, and pubs to name but a few. Mallow is just a ten-minute drive, while Fermoy can be reached in twenty minutes.\n\nAcoomodation includes a kitchen/dining, 2 bedrooms, utility and a shower room. With its convenient location, generous garden and scope for improvement this property offers excellent potential to any potential purchaser."
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "Accommodation",
        "SortOrder": 1,
        "Content": "\nKitchen - 5.11m x 3.8m\nTiled floor, fully fitted kitchen with intergrated hob and oven solid fuel fire with features surround\n\nBedroom 1 - 2.73m x 2.46m\nlaminate flooring\n\nBedroom 2 - 2m x 2.45m\nlaminate flooring\n\nUtility Room - 1.79m x 2.04m\nTiled flooring, Plumbed for washing machine.\n\nBathroom - 1.9m x 2.25m\nFully tiled, Whb and toilet, electric shower\n\n"
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "Features",
        "SortOrder": 3,
        "Content": "<ul><li>Attractive location</li><li>Off street parking </li><li>Elevated site overlooking Awbeg valley</ul>"
      },
